At this point the authenticated fresh-host provisioning/admission join was next:
cloud provenance must prove the work volume was newly created
without a snapshot, with encryption/retention, original deadlines and usable
bounded egress. Empty signature output alone does not prove a new volume or
exclude other-namespace writers. Native Linux qualification, retention/readback
and complete full-size authorization remain open. Public execution entries stay
closed. The cloud-check/setup connection is now recorded above; actual resource
creation is still pending. The earlier setup entries below are historical; the
