Historical setup connection update (2026-10-01): the [detached root setup entry](../scripts/run_sft_vm_setup_detached_v1.py)
and [controller-side setup join](../scripts/run_sft_vm_setup_delivery_v1.py) now connect
the existing seed/control upload to the frozen network/wheel/offline setup path.
Setup runs under one bounded systemd unit, not inside the short SSH connection.
Later pinned connections inspect exact receipts and successful terminal state,
then stop/reap the unit. Ambiguous dispatch or reap is not repeated. Original
