The new [source stager](../scripts/stage_sft_vm_fullsize_release_v1.py) lays out
the existing paths with root-private ancestors and worker-private source/output
directories, rejects reuse, preserves partial failures, and reads back file hashes.
The actual bundle passed a temporary-filesystem staging rehearsal with host/UID
admission doubled; all 303 selected local checks pass. Nothing was uploaded or
