checks all identity, permission and content metadata but excludes read access
time; the preserved v1 fails the reproducer while v2 passes. No earlier source
or receipt was overwritten.

The [root-controller installer](../scripts/stage_sft_vm_root_controller_v1.py)
now prepares and stages a separate 112,640-byte, 11-file source overlay. It
