The remote ceiling is 85 seconds, local exchange 100 seconds and bounded local
reap 5 seconds, within the existing 120-second tunnel. The reply is limited to
4096 bytes and must exactly match the typed aggregate staging receipt.

The sender consumes a fresh local marker, charges full attempted control content
and never resends. An ambiguous send remains remote-completion-unknown; local
SSH cleanup is not proof of remote termination. The content charge does not
measure SSH/EICE wire traffic or replace pending global network enforcement.
Fifteen new tests and 237 guarded regressions pass: real local pipes, preserved
